# Build context for the server image (apps/server/Dockerfile). The server runs the real engine, so the
# source and the card data are copied; everything heavy or machine-local is not. The offline single file
# (index.html) is never in the image - the server loads packages/ + data/ directly.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
build
.dsh-worktrees
.vscode
.idea
__pycache__
*.pyc
tests
docs/images
docs/design
docs/screenshots
data/sources
*.tgz
